{"sha": "79039007edcaa8f23f2422ce6c070d09a5fec9e289aed7f8d2473b6f6e37871b", "body": ["\\begin{method}[由薄透镜作像]\\label{met:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:lensrays}", "由 $B$ 发出的三条特殊光线：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 过 $O$：方向不变；", "  \\item 平行于主轴：出射后过 $F'$；", "  \\item 过 $F$：出射后平行于主轴。", "\\end{enumerate}", "任取两条即可；对于凹透镜，使用其延长线（射向", "透镜后方 $F$ 的光线出射后平行于主轴；平行光线出射后如同从", "前方 $F'$ 发出）。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm]", "  % converging lens f'=2 at O=(0,0); object at OA=-3, h=1 -> 1/OA' = 1/2 - 1/3 = 1/6 -> OA'=6, gamma=-2", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-4.3,0) -- (7.0,0);", "  \\draw[very thick, omDef, Stealth-Stealth] (0,-1.9) -- (0,1.9);", "  \\foreach \\x/\\n in {0/O, -2/F, 2/F'} {\\fill (\\x,0) circle (1.3pt); \\node[below] at (\\x,-0.05) {$\\n$};}", "  \\draw[-Stealth, very thick, omThm] (-3,0) -- (-3,0.9); \\node[above] at (-3,0.9) {$B$}; \\node[below] at (-3,-0.05) {$A$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, very thick, omThm] (6,0) -- (6,-1.8); \\node[below] at (6,-1.8) {$B'$}; \\node[above] at (6,0.05) {$A'$};", "  \\draw[omProp] (-3,0.9) -- (0,0.9) -- (6,-1.8);", "  \\draw[omExo] (-3,0.9) -- (6,-1.8);", "  \\draw[omThm!70] (-3,0.9) -- (0,-0.9) -- (6,-0.9);", "  \\node[omDef] at (0.55,1.75) {$L$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 凸透镜：物 $AB$ 位于 $F$ 之外。过 $O$ 的光线直行，", "平行光线经 $F'$ 折射，过 $F$ 的光线出射后平行于主轴，", "三条光线交于 $B'$：实像，倒立。此处", "$\\overline{OA} = -1.5f'$，故 $\\overline{OA'} = 3f'$，$\\gamma = -2$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm]", "  % diverging lens f'=-2 at O; object at OA=-3, h=1.2 -> 1/OA' = -1/2 - 1/3 = -5/6 -> OA' = -1.2, gamma = 0.4", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-4.3,0) -- (4.5,0);", "  \\draw[very thick, omDef, Stealth-Stealth] (0,-1.9) -- (0,1.9);", "  \\foreach \\x/\\n in {0/O, 2/F, -2/F'} {\\fill (\\x,0) circle (1.3pt); \\node[below] at (\\x,-0.05) {$\\n$};}", "  \\draw[-Stealth, very thick, omThm] (-3,0) -- (-3,1.2); \\node[above] at (-3,1.2) {$B$}; \\node[below] at (-3,-0.05) {$A$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, very thick, omThm] (-1.2,0) -- (-1.2,0.48); \\node[above] at (-1.2,0.5) {$B'$}; \\node[below] at (-1.2,-0.05) {$A'$};", "  \\draw[omProp] (-3,1.2) -- (0,1.2) -- (4.0,3.6*1.2/1.8+0) ;", "  \\draw[omProp, dashed] (0,1.2) -- (-2,0);", "  \\draw[omExo] (-3,1.2) -- (0,0) -- (4.0,-1.6);", "  \\draw[omExo, dashed] (-1.2,0.48) -- (0,0);", "  \\node[omDef] at (0.55,1.75) {$L$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 凹透镜（$F'$ 在前方，$F$ 在后方）：平行光线出射后如同从", "$F'$ 发出，过中心的光线直行；二者的反向延长线交于 $B'$，", "得到虚像：正立、缩小，", "且与物的位置无关。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[同一透镜的三种用法]\\label{ex:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:lensuses}", "凸透镜，$f' = \\qty{5.0}{cm}$。印章置于 \\qty{3.0}{cm} 处：", "$1/\\overline{OA'} = 1/5 - 1/3 = -2/15$，$\\overline{OA'} = \\qty{-7.5}{cm}$，", "虚像，$\\gamma = +2.5$：放大镜。灯置于 \\qty{20}{cm} 处：", "$\\overline{OA'} = \\qty{6.7}{cm}$，实像，$\\gamma = -1/3$：缩小的", "倒立像落在卡片上。窗户位于 \\qty{4}{m} 远处：$\\overline{OA'}", "\\approx f'$，焦平面上得到微小的倒立像——照相机。", "三种用法，同一关系。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[纵向放大率]\\label{prop:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:longitudinal}", "\\index{纵向放大率}", "若物沿主轴移动 $\\dd\\overline{OA}$，则像", "移动 $\\dd\\overline{OA'} = \\gamma^2\\,\\dd\\overline{OA}$，", "方向相同。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在 $f'$ 固定时对笛卡儿关系求微分：", "$-\\dd\\overline{OA'}/\\overline{OA'}^2 + \\dd\\overline{OA}/\\overline{OA}^2 = 0$,", "故 $\\dd\\overline{OA'} = (\\overline{OA'}/\\overline{OA})^2\\,\\dd\\overline{OA}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{remark}[焦深]\\label{rem:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:depth}", "投影仪的 $\\gamma = -50$，$\\gamma^2 = 2500$：一张幻灯片", "在灯的热量作用下弯曲 \\qty{0.1}{mm}，其像", "便偏离屏幕平面 \\qty{25}{cm}。反之，照相机（$\\abs\\gamma", "\\ll 1$）允许物有较大位移，而像仅产生微小移动——", "此即景深。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{焦距的测量}", "", "\\begin{method}[自准直法]\\label{met:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:autocollimation}", "\\index{自准直法}", "将平面镜紧贴放在透镜后方，沿主轴移动一个被照亮的物（毛玻璃上的", "十字），直到其经透镜后被镜面反射回来所成的像", "清晰地落在物本身上，且倒立、大小相同。", "此时物位于焦平面上：光线离开透镜时平行，", "经镜面返回后仍平行，并在焦平面上重新会聚。", "物与透镜的距离为 $f'$。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[贝塞尔法]\\label{prop:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:bessel}", "\\index{贝塞尔法}\\index{西尔伯曼法}", "物与屏相距 $D$ 固定。凸透镜", "在屏上形成清晰实像的位置：当 $D > 4f'$ 时恰有两个，", "当 $D = 4f'$ 时有一个，当 $D < 4f'$ 时则无。两位置", "相距 $d$，且", "\\[", "f' = \\frac{D^2 - d^2}{4D} .", "\\]", "当 $D = 4f'$（西尔伯曼法）时，唯一位置给出 $\\gamma = -1$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "设 $p = -\\overline{OA} > 0$ 为物与透镜的距离；则", "$\\overline{OA'} = D - p$，由笛卡儿关系得 $1/(D - p) + 1/p = 1/f'$，", "即 $p^2 - Dp + Df' = 0$：判别式为 $D^2 - 4Df'$，当且仅当", "$D > 4f'$ 时为正。两根 $p_{1,2} = (D \\mp \\sqrt{D^2 - 4Df'})/2$ 之和为", "$D$（两位置对称：物距与像距互换），", "二者之差为 $d = \\sqrt{D^2 - 4Df'}$，由此解出 $f'$。当", "$D = 4f'$ 时，$p = 2f' = \\overline{OA'}$，且 $\\gamma = -1$。", "\\end{proof}", ""]}